845275},{"frame":56,"img":{"x":1006,"y":646},"wallX":1357.6279937167938,"wallY":384.47030281351164},{"frame":57,"img":{"x":1850,"y":612},"wallX":2718.2621023075403,"wallY":327.71660382122076},{"frame":58,"img":{"x":1674,"y":700},"wallX":2440.903261972882,"wallY":472.70936495297707},{"frame":59,"img":{"x":1616,"y":708},"wallX":2348.2080714471736,"wallY":486.11954518058775},{"frame":60,"img":{"x":1914,"y":861},"wallX":2829.327373221323,"wallY":737.8993473706192}],"transcript":"alright so here's the first window you can see it's got shutters in front of it um the window is like from there to there and the and the A4 piece of paper is there I just measured it up um from like the edge of the frame which is like that bit there to the other side not just for the shutters are and it was 222 centimetres wide wide um so yeah we'd want a pole that covers like the whole of the the section along the top of the frame um 222 centimeters might not be entirely exact but that's me measuring it so yeah you get the idea","options":[{"stockCm":300,"cutToMm":2550,"cutPerEndMm":225,"overhangEachSideMm":175.97685501180672,"twoPiece":true,"brackets":3,"fit":"ideal","overallWithFinialsMm":2730,"note":"cut 22.5 cm off each end"},{"stockCm":240,"cutToMm":null,"cutPerEndMm":0,"overhangEachSideMm":100.97685501180672,"twoPiece":true,"brackets":3,"fit":"tight","overallWithFinialsMm":2580,"note":"use as supplied; a little tight for curtains to clear the glass"}],"timingsMs":{"uploadMs":7341,"handsMs":17998,"measureMs":17998,"windowOutline":0,"framesWithHandsSetAside":1,"handsTimedOut":1,"spanMs":18844,"draftMs":18090,"totalMs":57560},"models":["sam-3.1","sam-3.1 (video tracking: hands)","muse-voice-transcribe-1.0","muse-spark-1.3 (which edges)","muse-spark-1.3"],"widthMm":2198.0462899763866,"heightMm":1353.5678209288328,"spreadMm":25.869521368090318,"framesUsed":6,"heroFrame":18,"span":{"adopted":false,"widthMm":2198.0462899763866,"frameWidthMm":2198.0462899763866,"why":"outer trim edges","left":"A","right":"B","edges":[{"xMm":232.4608776406535,"strength":0,"label":"A","measured":true},{"xMm":2430.50716761704,"strength":0,"label":"B","measured":true},{"xMm":2550.4642825852206,"strength":57.33963274419448,"label":"C"},{"xMm":2647.8179400436024,"strength":42.5224258879439,"label":"D"},{"xMm":2861.6657973303386,"strength":44.384288307195966,"label":"E"}],"votes":"3 of 3 agreed with the outline"},"handSpan":{"leftPastFrameMm":75.35461470822847,"rightPastFrameMm":398.8202056042828},"draft":{"curtainType":"unknown","chosenStockCm":300,"diameterMm":35,"reply":"Thanks for the video. I make the outside of the frame 219.8 cm which lines up with your 222 cm. I would go with the 300 cm pole cut to 255 cm with 22.5 cm off each end. That gives 17.6 cm past the frame each side.\n\nThe 240 cm used as supplied is the alternative with 10.1 cm past the frame each side but it is a little tight for curtains to clear the glass. Both sizes come in two pieces with 3 brackets. Please allow 9 cm at each end for the finials and check the 255 cm before you cut as I cannot accept returns on cut poles. Best wishes, Rob","questions":["What type of curtains will you be hanging"],"ranOn":"muse-spark-1.3"},"fps":3,"blinds":{"options":[{"fit":"outside, standard","widthMm":2295,"dropMm":1450,"overlapEachSideMm":50,"note":"covers the opening with a little to spare each side"},{"fit":"outside, blackout","widthMm":2355,"dropMm":1450,"overlapEachSideMm":80,"note":"wider overlap so less light gets round the sides"}],"draft":{"reply":"Thanks so much for the clip, that is really helpful. I measured the outside of the window frame or its surround as 219.8 cm wide by 135.4 cm high, so your tape was very close.\n\nIf you order outside fit, I suggest:\nstandard at 229.5 cm wide with 145 cm drop, which gives 5 cm overlap each side and covers the opening with a little to spare each side\nblackout at 235.5 cm wide with 145 cm drop, which gives 8 cm overlap each side for wider overlap so less light gets round the sides\n\nJust let me know which suits best.\nBest wishes","questions":[]},"model":"muse-spark-1.3"}}